# Packages fetched from https://pkgs.omamobile.org/stable/aarch64/ and
# published into the local [lenovomarchy] pacman repository (aarch64).
#
# Format: <pkgname> <mode>
#   copy-any       : upstream pkg already has arch=any; copy after SHA-256 + GPG check
#   copy-elf       : upstream pkg is tagged arch=aarch64 (it may contain ELF
#                    binaries); copy after SHA-256 + GPG check. The signature
#                    check is the trust boundary here: the key's fingerprint
#                    must match tools/omamobile-trusted.fpr, and the signing
#                    subkey's fingerprint is accepted alongside the primary's
#                    (the release key certifies only; a subkey signs).

omamobile-remote     copy-any
omacam               copy-elf
omamobile-settings   copy-elf
wlrctl               copy-elf
